  <heading level="1">1.6 Sampling Experiment</heading>
  <note type="sidebar" source_type="Stats Lab" title="Stats Lab">
    <heading level="3">Sampling Experiment</heading>
    <paragraph>Class Time:</paragraph>
    <paragraph>Names:</paragraph>
    <list type="unordered">
      <item>The student will demonstrate the simple random, systematic, stratified, and cluster sampling techniques.</item>
      <item>The student will explain the details of each procedure used.</item>
    </list>
